{"_v":1,"id":"back-to-the-future-west-end-2021","bd":{"positive":9,"mixed":1,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"Kev 4254","o":"The Times (UK)","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.show-score.com/uk/london/west-end-shows/back-to-the-future-london","q":"This musical adaptation of Robert Zemeckis’s hit 1985 time-travel movie is enormous fun."},{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/back-future-musical-review-cars-star-feelgood-triumph/","d":"2021-09-13","q":"It’s a feelgood triumph. Is it the most sophisticated musical around? No, but it’s a no less exhilarating all-American entertainment drive-thru than Hamilton."},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-b954981.html","d":"2021-09-13","q":"Even without Bart, though, director John Rando, choreographer Chris Bailey and designer Tim Hatley have together crafted a near-seamless slice of escapist entertainment."},{"cn":"David Benedict","o":"Variety","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2021/legit/reviews/back-to-the-future-musical-review-west-end-1235063882/","d":"2021-09-14","q":"Is it a great musical? Absolutely not."},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2021/sep/13/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-adelphi-theatre","d":"2021-09-13","q":"Despite its inventions and its abundant splashiness, it is an odd mishmash of originality and imitation, the DeLorean remaining its biggest star."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-classic-stalls-like-an-old-delorean-njg5tp88x?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqf-6wn6DKrFsTE7Z0HLjPVLGSt4d0rpN6dBf0Wmj6QESad0D_05YlQf&gaa_ts=699b8aa1&gaa_sig=RiG1Bk1yTdai4IcIB88Z7pUq3_2X3t1Elw8YXVEc4zNaTHezETr13lhTyYrfR21Pcb_xGzD3pVeBGjXkRQJIkQ%3D%3D","d":"2021-09-13","q":"It's like sitting in a musty, 40-year-old DeLorean and discovering that the engine keeps stalling."},{"cn":"Sam Marlowe","o":"The i","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://inews.co.uk/culture/back-to-the-future-the-musical-adelphi-theatre-london-review-an-eye-popping-gen-x-nostalgia-trip-1196192?srsltid=AfmBOooHnp6NYmfVbVw0ZbmDtrny4Jcz0PLmxCnQUhXyxeaMbEaa_wvI","d":"2021-09-13","q":"Once the dazzle of John Rando’s production wears off, though, it all feels a bit pointless."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/back-to-the-future-the-musical-review-the-iconic-movie-makes-its-way-to-the-west-end-stage_54896/","d":"2021-09-13","q":"It's undoubtedly an evening that sends you back to your own future with a smile on your face, a perfect night out for nostalgics and car-loving kids of all ages."},{"cn":"Clarisse Loughrey","o":"The Independent","s":71,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/back-to-the-future-musical-review-b1919866.html","d":"2021-09-14","q":"For all the care that’s gone into replicating its source material, what feels most authentic about Back to the Future: The Musical is its capacity for pure spectacle."},{"cn":"Marianka Swain","o":"London Theatre","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/back-to-the-future-review-adelphi-theatre","d":"2021-09-28","q":"After two viewings, I'd be hard pressed to reproduce much of the original score."},{"cn":"Theatre Bee (UK)","o":"Theatre Bee","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.theatrebee.com/post/review-back-to-the-future-olivier-award-well-deserved","d":"2022-05-20","q":"An absolutely electrifying show."},{"cn":"Gary Naylor","o":"The Arts Desk","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"http://theartsdesk.com/theatre/back-future-musical-adelphi-theatre-review-spectacular-west-end-show-delight-fans-old-and-new","d":"2021-09-28","q":"Picking up a blockbuster movie and dropping it on to a stage is far trickier than it sounds."}],"au":{"score":86,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":86,"c":6772,"sr":4.3}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/gmoB5Dwvs23EaX6dDaOT1/853a537ca5437a7156dfa4c8f543506e/BTTF-2026-01-57196SA-BBs-TTG-PrimaryImage-1440x580.jpg?fm=webp&q=90"}